# Pin line endings for this recipe.
#
# The workflow JSON embeds the contents of examples/classify.mjs, and one test asserts the
# two still match. Without this, a Windows clone checks the .mjs out with CRLF while the
# embedded copy inside the JSON keeps \n, and that test fails for everyone who clones the
# repository while passing for whoever wrote it.
*.mjs  text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
